			"text":"# Info\nThe teacher that worked on the now closed [[Schoolhouse.canvas|Schoolhouse]], supposedly was the principal of [[Reddington Elementary.canvas|Reddington Elementary]].\n\nShe has an interest in some old documents related to the Sigils it seems and was communicating about them on letters traded with other scholars.\n\n**This information is not very accurate, the names might be mixed.**",
